 at several widths. A 1 px border, an easing curve and a\nmissing hover state were all invisible in screenshots and obvious in a diff. See\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/migration/conformance","children":[{"type":"text","value":"conformance"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"habits-for-a-new-project","text":"Habits for a new project","level":1},{"id":"structure","text":"Structure","level":2},{"id":"1-one-styles-object-per-module-named-by-part","text":"1. One styles object per module, named by part","level":3},{"id":"2-components-take-sx-and-put-it-last","text":"2. Components take sx, and put it last","level":3},{"id":"3-take-sx-out-of-the-rest-spread","text":"3. Take sx out of the rest spread","level":3},{"id":"4-installed-components-do-not-read-sx","text":"4. Installed components do not read sx","level":3},{"id":"values","text":"Values","level":2},{"id":"5-start-with-plain-values-adopt-scales-when-they-repeat","text":"5. Start with plain values; adopt scales when they repeat","level":3},{"id":"6-put-product-decisions-in-your-own-tokens","text":"6. Put product decisions in your own tokens","level":3},{"id":"7-a-font-size-comes-with-its-line-height","text":"7. A font size comes with its line height","level":3},{"id":"8-name-the-longhands-you-set","text":"8. Name the longhands you set","level":3},{"id":"overrides-and-states","text":"Overrides and states","level":2},{"id":"9-override-under-the-same-condition","text":"9. Override under the same condition","level":3},{"id":"10-nest-the-winner-inside-the-other-condition","text":"10. Nest the winner inside the other condition","level":3},{"id":"11-put-the-relation-anchor-where-the-state-lives","text":"11. Put the relation anchor where the state lives","level":3},{"id":"12-a-parent-s-rule-ranks-below-the-child-s-own","text":"12. A parent's rule ranks below the child's own","level":3},{"id":"13-animate-the-property-you-set","text":"13. Animate the property you set","level":3},{"id":"runtime-values","text